<title>INDIA: India ICICI looks to place on-tap bonds.</title>
<headline>India ICICI looks to place on-tap bonds.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Industrial Credit and Investment Corp of India (ICICI) said it was looking to place on-tap bonds at an annualised yield of 15.75 percent for three-year and 16.5 percent for five years.</p>
<p>ICICI is one of India's leading term-lending banks.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
